    "title": "KoalaBear degree-12 B0 K8-nonzero F_(p^6) exclusion",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "four exact zero-dimensional degree-six quotient certificates, with an independent F04 eliminant and five terminal fibers",
    "statement": "For each of F04-R02, F05-R02, F06-R02, and F07-R02, saturating the B0 core ideal by V*K8*(s^2-4pvar) gives a zero-dimensional basis of size 25,25,26,26. After adjoining the exact degree-six field equations, the complete named-open product reduces to zero in every quotient. Hence all four complete named-open B0 charts with K8 nonzero are empty over F_(p^6). The F04-R02 degree-30 s eliminant and its five exact linear fibers provide an independent cross-check. No K8=0 or R20 claim is made.",
